# 2026-11-20: the Galaxy S26 (SM-S942Q) LiteRT-LM GPU rows of the five composite files
# (*_gpu_composite_v0190.litertlm) of LFM2.5-350M, LFM2-700M, LFM2-2.6B, LFM2-2.6B-Exp and Qwen3.5 0.8B on the side
# build v0.19.0-pregpu: LiteRT-LM v0.19.0 (771b06e1) with its prebuilt GPU accelerator libLiteRtGpuAccelerator.so
# loaded at run time (android/engine-pins.json litert-lm.v0.19.0-pregpu), the build of the weekly dashboard-text-v1
# GPU rows. Same files, model ids and cooldowns as the composite rows of matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-public-android.cells, which
# ran them on LiteRT-LM's public prebuilt binaries (GPU accelerator compiled in). In one set of runs on 2026-11-20
# (matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-textcheck-bench-build-android.cells, results/raw/2026-11-20-lfm2-qwen35-s26-textcheck-h2-android) the
# public prebuilt's GPU prefill on the LFM2 int4 and Qwen3.5 int8 files read 0.45-0.72x this build's.
# Task: native-benchmark-1024x256 = litert_lm_advanced_main --benchmark, prefill forced to exactly 1024 tokens,
# decode 256, context 2048 (methodology/protocol-gemma4.md "The spec").
# Files: the Hub files of 2026-11-20, each read at the repo revision on its comment line and checked against the Hub
# API's LFS sha256 (size and sha256 below); file= is the checked copy's path from the repo root (the job runs the
# runner there; .dashboard/ is not in git).
# First row = the Android llama.cpp session anchor row of matrices/anchors.cells byte for byte.
# Cooldowns: the runner's 120 s, cooldown=300 on the two 2.6B rows. No runs= (3 runs per row, round by round).
# Text check before the sitting: matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-textcheck-pregpu-composite-android.cells.
# Run from the repo root with the phone reserved for the whole run (the job does not reserve or free it):
#   BENCH_SITTING=1 python3 scripts/dashboard_job.py s26 --cells matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-pregpu-composite-android.cells --suffix lfm2-qwen35-composite --once --hold-held-by <pid that reserved the phone> --no-post
# The campaign name holds `dashboard`; the page reads this file's rows only once the dashboard lists this file.
android llama.cpp unsloth/Qwen3-0.6B-GGUF short-chat anchor=1 runs=3 file=Qwen3-0.6B-Q4_K_M.gguf
